/**
 * Kurmancî (KU) -> German (DE) forward lookup dataset, and the DE -> KU
 * reverse index, both GENERATED FILES, DO NOT EDIT BY HAND.
 *
 * Same pipeline and rules as ku-data.ts / tr-data.ts (see
 * KURDISH-ATTRIBUTION.md) — just a different `translations.language_code`
 * ('de' instead of 'tr') drawn from the SAME Ferheng+ v2.5.0 SQLite export.
 * Only entries whose lowercased headword doesn't collide with a different
 * dictionary entry are kept (`ambiguous_cross_entry` — 0 collisions in this
 * release, same as the KU/TR dataset). Multi-sense / cross-POS headwords are
 * NOT excluded: every German translation an included entry has (deduped,
 * capped at 5, in source `translations` row-id order) is kept.
 *
 * Forward format: headword \t de1|de2|...  (up to 5, "|"-separated)
 * Reverse format: de_string \t ku_headword1|ku_headword2|...  (up to 5)
 *
 * Held as plain strings, same reasoning as KU_FORWARD_TSV/TR_REVERSE_TSV: a
 * large literal is parsed as code on cold start, a string is not, until
 * something actually splits it.
 */

